CONCLUSION:
  (A) Im/Re ~ 1e-15 on every lattice: n<->-n pairing makes correction REAL. CONFIRMED.
  (B) within-orbit weight spread is LARGE (0.3-1.2), NOT ~0: the F7* trace collapse
      does NOT regroup the lattice sum. CONFIRMED.
  (C) sum|W| (the honest envelope) GROWS with L: no finite magnitude bound from trace.
  => QR/Gauss angle gives EXACT REALITY reduction, NOT a wide-E magnitude bound.
